@@ -94,6 +94,18 @@ Repeated use SHOULD make the interaction faster, clearer and less repetitive wit
 
 Cached output is never proof authority. A warm path MUST preserve the same mandatory checks as a cold path. Cache invalidation follows source, repository, tool/model, policy, normalization and human-correction changes.
 
+An authorized work ring MUST NOT end merely because the client emitted a progress
+message, one internal check succeeded, or a chat turn reached a convenient
+boundary. While one safe, deterministic and already authorized next action
+exists, execute it, reobserve its effect, and continue. Return only when the
+requested scope is verifiably complete, a concrete external or permission
+boundary has no authorized repair, or a genuinely non-deterministic owner choice
+is required. Before an unavoidable return, persist enough exact-bound state for
+another client to resume from repository evidence. The PR-940 case study and
+machine contract are bound in
+`docs/PR940_BEWEISAPPARAT_UND_SCHNITTSTELLENKONTINUITAET.md` and
+`policy/HUMAN_MACHINE_INTERFACE_ADAPTATION_V1.json`.
+
 PUBLICATION AND REFERENCE OVERVIEW
 
